{"id": "66741", "title": "火", "author": "湿手摸电门", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 13, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/66/66741.htm", "intro": "本文原名《浴火》，第一部已经完结，第二部《陶醉》已开坑。\r\n面对重重诱惑折磨和狼一般的男人们，她仍坚信，活着，比什么都重要\r\n因为【浴火】时，涅盘后，终将新生\r\n一女【多】男，高干腹黑，养成，教导，报复，缠绵，【口口世界】的黑色童话\r\n1，yin而不荡，哀而不伤，本文放荡不羁，不喜误入\r\n2，只求皮鞭儿沾凉水，皮开肉绽的请去看谍战片\r\n3，只求碧血洗银枪，雅蠛蝶儿的请去看岛国片", "base": "files/article/html/66/66741", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "10147412.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "10147414.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "10147415.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "10147416.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "10147417.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "10147418.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "10147419.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "10147421.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-87", "file": "10147422.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-5", "file": "10147423.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10147424.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10147426.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-23", "file": "10147427.html", "available": false}]}